cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the papers of the backbone methods you used (networkx_backbone.describe_backbone lists them)."
title: "networkx-backbone: Backbone extraction algorithms for complex networks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Keegan
    given-names: Brian C.
    email: brian.keegan@colorado.edu
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/brianckeegan/networkx_backbone"
url: "https://www.brianckeegan.com/networkx_backbone/"
abstract: >-
  Backbone extraction algorithms for complex networks, built on NetworkX:
  statistical, structural, proximity, hybrid, bipartite-projection,
  unweighted and hypergraph backbones, with filters, multiple-testing
  correction and evaluation measures.
keywords:
  - network backbone
  - network science
  - NetworkX
  - graph sparsification
  - hypergraphs
